Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:04.24,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,If you're really married, \Nthen prove it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:07.23,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Kiss right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.63,0:00:09.28,main,Loid,0,0,0,,If that's all it takes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.00,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,A kiss? A kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.29,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:22.84,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I've read somewhere that \Nyour first kiss tastes like lemons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That'll go perfectly with \Nthis marinated fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:29.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Calm down, Yor! Get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:30.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:33.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,O-O-O-One second, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.47,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,There is no way I can do this sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:42.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Fank you for waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:47.82,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We don't have to do this \Nif you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:52.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,This ish for my sake, as well. \NI will do my besht.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:54.03,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,What are you two whispering about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:55.80,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Can you do it or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.57,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Prove to me that you're \Nreally a married couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:02.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Keep your mouf shut, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:06.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We will now show you just how in wuv we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here I come, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Now, cwose your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.34,0:01:12.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,S-Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Um... Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:53.98,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(261,165)\fscx60}SHOW OFF HOW IN LOVE YOU ARE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.79,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,How lewd!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.57,flashback,Little Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.47,0:03:14.55,flashback,Little Yuri,0,0,0,,Look! I scored the highest \Nin my whole class!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.30,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, how wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.66,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll reward you with a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:19.54,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.43,0:03:23.80,flashback,Little Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:26.28,flashback,Little Yuri,0,0,0,,When I grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:29.54,flashback,Little Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm gonna marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.48,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.07,0:03:34.21,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll just have \Nto wait patiently for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.07,flashback italics,Yor (Echo),0,0,0,,...wait patiently for you. \N{\fs20}...wait patiently for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:37.81,flashback italics,Yor (Echo),0,0,0,,{\fs16}...wait patiently for you. \N{\fs12}...wait patiently for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:40.31,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:42.65,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,You can't, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:46.34,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Seeing you kiss another man \Nin front of me is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:48.52,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I won't allow—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:52.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:56.79,top,Yuri,0,0,0,,—itpppppbt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:59.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:06.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Izzit the end of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:13.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?! Um, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:20.30,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I see how it is, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.60,0:04:24.35,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,You're going to treat me like that just \Nbecause I tried to stop you from kissing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.77,0:04:27.96,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I guess you just couldn't wait to \Ndo naughty things with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.35,0:04:31.83,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I was a fool to test you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.59,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Perhaps my feelings were what \Nwas truly being tested here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:38.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Um... more importantly, you're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:43.83,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Loid Forger... You may lay claim \Non my sister's lips for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:44.39,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.05,0:04:54.50,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Right... Well, I'll let you \Noff the hook for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:55.39,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,But just remember—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, really. You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:04:59.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is this just normal for the Briars?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:03.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Yuri? \NYou're about to fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.80,top,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you really just say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.36,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Well, so are you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:12.72,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Shall I call you a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:16.24,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I'm fine. You're such a worrywart, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:20.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Whoa, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.79,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Wipe that smirk off your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:26.28,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Are my failures that amusing to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:30.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, no. I was just admiring \Nwhat lovely siblings you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You must have always been \Nthere for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:37.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yuri, thank you for protecting \NYor up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've been through many hardships.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:45.22,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll also do everything I can to \Nbe there for her from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:47.81,main,Loid,0,0,0,,so let's do everything we can \Nto make sure Yor is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.32,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Like I'd ever ask for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.45,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Forget it! I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Feel free to come over anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:00.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure that'll make Yor happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.55,0:06:03.28,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You should come when my \Ndaughter's awake next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:07.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Miss Anya was doing everything she \Ncould to stay up to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:10.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,She's absolutely precious, \Nso I hope you'll play with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:13.18,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I don't need him to invite me! I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:17.71,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll prove that \Nyou're tricking my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:19.64,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I am not being tricked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.73,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Now, hear me, Loid Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:24.23,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,If you make my sister cry even a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:26.27,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I will have you ex—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:30.28,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Um... well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:33.20,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Just know that you'll rue the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.04,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Be careful getting home, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:37.36,top,Yuri,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Be mindful of your yelling! \NIt'll disturb the neighbors!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:40.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Was he about to say he'd have me executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:41.91,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:51.16,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Any wiretaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:53.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Looks like we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Since he's with the secret police...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:58.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, because he's her brother,\N he may just try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:06:59.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to be on my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:02.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm a bit embarrassed to say so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:09.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but thank you for welcoming him into \Nyour family, despite his rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:14.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yuri clearly loves you very much, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:19.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't have any family or friends \NI can rely on, other than my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:21.94,main,Loid,0,0,0,,so I admit that I was a \Nlittle envious of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:23.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:25.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Though my daughter is also\N just part of a pretend family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:29.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, anyway. I'm glad he didn't find \Nout about our pretend marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:33.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:38.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly very tired, \Nnow that I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why don't we head to bed after we clean up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:45.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, in separate beds, of course!\N I'll change things back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:46.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:51.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa... Pwease save Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:57.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Now, Yuri... You'll make \Nme mad if you hit Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:05.23,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't remember the last time \NI felt envious of another.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:09.13,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I should sleep. I'm sure I'm just exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:11.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yet my mission still continues on tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:20.26,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.08,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Which way is the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:29.12,main,Passerby A&B,0,0,0,,Get to the hospital first, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:35.40,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Morning, pwease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.89,0:08:39.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You seem very green today, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.53,0:08:41.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Quit talking in your sleep \Nand go wash your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's too bad you didn't get \Nto meet Yuri yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:09:00.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?! But she was so looking \Nforward to meeting him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Things sure did get lively yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.22,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Who'd have thought Yor's \Nbrother would be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:09.99,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh! Unkie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:13.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And he's part of the secret police, \Nmy greatest foe as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:17.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,S-Secret police?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.10,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:23.49,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,"Secret" plus "police"...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.37,0:09:26.50,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That sounds so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.28,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Why didn't you introduce me to him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Gimme back the excitement I wasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.79,0:09:32.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You wanted to meet him that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:35.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, at least the storm has passed for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.99,0:09:39.02,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to concentrate on Anya's education.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.02,0:09:41.79,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up and eat. You'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.90,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Om... nom...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.90,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you'll see \Nbe able to see him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Has the threat truly passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor Briar, whose younger brother \Nis a member of the secret police...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:57.40,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Previously, there was nothing \Nsuspicious surrounding her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:00.96,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She didn't seem to know what her \Nbrother's true occupation is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.73,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,so my intuition says she's still clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.73,0:10:05.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Besides, if she knew her brother \Nworked at the State Security Service,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:08.41,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,there'd be no concern over suspicions \Narising about her being single.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, it's dangerous to be too certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:14.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What if she was just acting and this \Nwas all a lie to get closer to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Suspect everything, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.34,0:10:22.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, Mama is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:24.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:28.24,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.25,main,Anya,0,0,0,,bad at cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:34.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So it was obvious that I made\N breakfast this morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.88,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:37.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I did do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, by the way, Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:50.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess putting a listening device \Non her is going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.99,0:10:53.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, I need to silence any doubts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.50,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Even a moment's carelessness \Ncould mean death.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:59.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It could also mean the lives \Nof tens of thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to do this to prove Yor's innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:03.80,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You've got something on your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:08.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:11.68,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That startled me. I thought he was \Ngoing to give me a kiss goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.40,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:16.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I s-still haven't forgotten \Nabout last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.67,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't kiss or even cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.27,0:11:24.50,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid managed to smooth \Nthings over last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:28.51,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but I'm probably not acting like a proper wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:34.12,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I may be imagining it, but Loid \Nseems a bit more distant today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:39.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Maybe he's gotten sick of \Nme being so disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:41.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I need to be on my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:53.05,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:57.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama and Papa need to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:02.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,W-Well, we aren't fighting or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:07.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And you make sure you get \Nalong with your classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:09.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:12.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We should get going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:13.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:18.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Children are so curiously observant at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:28.01,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:30.80,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Why are you covered in bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.27,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Didn't you go celebrate your \Nsister's wedding yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:36.09,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I don't really remember what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.07,0:12:40.94,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You probably got drunk and picked \Na fight with her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.62,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You really need to quit drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.66,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,Well, I can't let a guy like \Nthat be with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.49,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Was he that disagreeable?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.81,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:53.20,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:55.65,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:59.72,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,But con men and spies always \Ntry to act like good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.48,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,That's it! Hopefully he's a spy! \NThen I can throw him in a cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:04.55,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Calm down. Do you have any proof of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.17,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.17,0:13:10.07,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,I totally forgot to bug their\N living room and bedrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.23,0:13:12.77,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.71,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,If I happened to hear Sis's \Nvoice in {\i0}those{\i1} situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:17.53,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,my heart wouldn't be able to bear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:19.26,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Did you give yourself those injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:27.79,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You need to detach from your sister so \Nyou can concentrate on your work more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:30.22,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Our job is to capture
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.45,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,spies from the West, namely, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:38.05,main,First Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Because that will lead \Nto your sister's safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:40.97,main,Yuri,0,0,0,,I know that. For now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:46.43,italics,Yuri,0,0,0,,Loid Forger, the day you make my sister cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:53.38,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:56.80,main,Millie,0,0,0,,She said something like, \N"I'm a failure of a wife."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:57.75,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,Heya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.00,main,Millie,0,0,0,,Oh, Sharon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:04.07,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,Huh? How do you become a good wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:06.25,main,Sharon,0,0,0,,Are you two not getting along?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:08.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Well, it's not exactly that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:08.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's just... This is my first time \Nbeing with a man in general,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:12.32,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's just... This is my first time \Nbeing with a man in general,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:14.97,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,so I'm unsure of how to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:18.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I was curious when I looked \Ninto her past connections,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.67,0:14:22.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but I guess Yor has really \Nnever dated a man before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.30,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm worried that things \Ncan't go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:29.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It doesn't help that I can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:31.49,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya's words really got to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:37.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It appears that Yor is trying to seem more \Nwifely for the sake of our pretend family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:39.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:43.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She could also be trying to act like the \Nperfect wife to put one over on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:47.25,italics,Camilla,0,0,0,,It must be rough when your husband \Nis clearly so much better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.37,italics,Millie,0,0,0,,Why don't you two just call it quits?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:51.67,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Er, I'd like to avoid that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.67,0:14:55.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor's relationship with her \Ncoworkers seems a bit, er, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:56.58,italics,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Hey, you four!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:14:57.45,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Hey, you four!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:14:59.27,main,Section chief,0,0,0,,Quit yapping and get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.76,main,Camilla,0,0,0,,Gah! It's the section chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:02.84,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Say, Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:06.58,main,Section Chief,0,0,0,,Could you go drop this off \Nat the post office for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:07.89,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:12.33,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to make a move if \NI want to clear the air for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:24.34,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Loid and \NI have separate bank accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:29.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I contributed a bit of my \Nearnings from my actual job,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:32.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,would I be able to help Loid out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:34.83,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But I can't make him suspicious of me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:39.93,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Not to mention, I don't think this \Nwas really a financial issue...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:43.20,main,Fake Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You there. I'd like to \Nask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:46.58,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,May we have a bit of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:49.09,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-The secret police!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.09,0:15:51.49,main,Yor,0,0,0,,D-Did I do something wrong, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:56.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Was I being far too suspicious by \Nlooking at ads meant for families,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.89,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,when I'm clearly lacking as a wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:00.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm married!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.82,main,Fake Second Lieutenant,0,0,0,,We're not hitting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:05.56,flashback,Franky,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:08.07,flashback,Franky,0,0,0,,You call me outta nowhere and \Ntell me to dress like this
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.48,flashback,Franky,0,0,0,,so we can question your wife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.72,0:16:13.05,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,Just shut up and follow the plan. \NThis is all for my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:14.85,flashback,Franky,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to do with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:19.20,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,We are inspecting the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.31,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,You just tried to mail this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:24.24,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,But it clearly contains a code\N meant for the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.40,main,Fake Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Is the sender, Burns, your superior?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:28.83,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:30.01,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yor Bri—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:33.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-It's Yor Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.37,0:16:38.26,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Well, well, well... Yor Forger, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:43.26,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,It clearly states your name \Nright here as a collaborator!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:44.74,italics,Fake Lieutenant (Loid),0,0,0,,He's really into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:47.32,main,Fake Lieutenant,0,0,0,,So you're in cahoots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:50.33,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I have no idea about this. \NThis must be some kind of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:52.27,main,Fake Second Lieutenant,0,0,0,,You'd be better off if you told the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:56.70,main,Fake Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Speaking of city hall, someone from the \Nfinance department was caught the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.56,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,Clearly, the corruption within \Nhas spread far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.56,0:17:02.29,main,Fake second Lieutenant,0,0,0,,I heard he met a pitiful end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.76,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,The intense torture got to \Nhim physically and mentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.04,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,and he apparently offed himself in his cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:12.23,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,And I heard last month, they caught \Nanother woman around this chick's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:14.23,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,You know, that official's secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.23,0:17:16.49,italics,Fake Lieutenant (Loid),0,0,0,,What kind of characterization is he going for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:18.02,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,Ah, her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.02,0:17:21.34,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,She was freed once we found out she \Nhad family in State Security Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.49,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Man, talk about an awesome benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:27.99,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Our family members can be let off \Nthe hook of most allegations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:31.03,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,Enough talking. You'll be \Ncoming with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:34.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If she's aware that Yuri works \Nfor the State Security Service,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:36.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,this will all be solved as soon \Nas she mentions Yuri's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:40.45,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's no reason for her to be \Nsecretive to one of his coworkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:44.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and if she resists, she'll further\N make us suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:49.10,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Come on, Yor. If you're in on this,\N ask your brother for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:51.05,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And if you're not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.47,0:17:52.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:56.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,work hard every day for the \Ncitizens of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:58.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I would never participate in espionage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.09,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,No use playing dumb with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:02.25,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Just shut up and come with—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.71,0:18:06.12,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:09.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm quite certain I mentioned \Nthat I was married.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please do not touch me so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.12,0:18:15.42,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,You do realize you're putting your family \Nin danger by doing this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:18.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My younger brother and husband are both kind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:19.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,and upstanding members of society.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If you ever unjustly harm either of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:28.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I frankly do not care if \NI'm dealing with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:30.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I will show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.58,main,Fake Lieutenant,0,0,0,,Hey, Second Lieutenant Mop...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:39.78,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,Are you certain about this cipher?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.41,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,What? Of course I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:42.83,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.12,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,Looking closer, this is clearly \Nnot the raccoon cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.12,0:18:47.08,main,Fake second lieutenant,0,0,0,,It's the caterpillar cipher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.97,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,If we decode this message...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:52.44,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,This is a letter Burns sent to a \Nrenowned hemorrhoids doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.32,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:56.85,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,I see. He used a cipher because\N he was embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.85,0:18:58.78,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,How confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.54,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,So, yes, it would appear \Nwe had the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.34,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,Your name isn't on here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:07.78,main,Fake lieutenant,0,0,0,,You may leave, but make sure you keep \Nquiet about this for Mr. Burns's sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.54,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, that was quite the farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:20.66,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Considering how she acted, it's pretty clear \Nshe has no connections with the secret police.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:26.45,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, come on. Don't tell me you \Nfeel guilty for doubting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.45,0:19:27.43,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:31.24,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I've warned you about this before, but don't\N develop unnecessary feelings for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:34.17,main,Franky,0,0,0,,If you value your life, don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:37.62,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We have no other way to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.65,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Somehow, it's extremely infuriating \Nto hear those words from that face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.41,0:19:46.49,main,Franky,0,0,0,,But {\i1}you{\i0} made that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:49.94,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Damn it! I thought I could land \Na few chicks with that face on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.39,main,Franky,0,0,0,,My precious hot-guy face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.39,0:19:55.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's a terrible idea to date \Na woman while deceiving her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:56.91,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Did you really just say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:04.70,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Today was terribly nerve-wracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:08.84,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I was almost arrested, meaning not \Nonly would I be ruined as a wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:10.81,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,but I would've destroyed the Forgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.60,0:20:13.25,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.35,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:17.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What a coincidence. Why don't\N we go home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.15,0:20:19.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh? There's something on \Nyour collar again, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:29.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Apparently, I'm such a failure as wife that \NI can't even keep up proper appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:33.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me, Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:38.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Perhaps many families throughout this \Nworld are somehow putting on an act,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:41.64,main,Loid,0,0,0,,thinking, "A wife should be like this," \Nor, "You're supposed to be the parent."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:45.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course, I believe that working hard \Nto be your best self is admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:49.88,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But if you dwell on that so \Nmuch that you lose yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,things that should go well might fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:58.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Many people suffering like that \Ncome to my hospital all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:03.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Putting on an act all the \Ntime can become tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:06.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:09.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And that's why I want you \Nto be as you are, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The more confident you seem, \Nthe less people will suspect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:17.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,And I'm sure Anya will be \Nhappier seeing you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:21.36,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm truly grateful that I married you, Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.12,flashback italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you feel \Nguilty for doubting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.97,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What did you just throw away?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.97,0:21:48.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, just the lint I found \Non your collar earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:49.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.89,main,Loid,0,0,0,,we didn't even do anything to celebrate \Nour one-year wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.89,0:21:55.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why don't we buy some cake on our way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.87,0:21:57.30,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That's a lovely idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.87,0:22:06.14,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, Mama! I have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:09.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.76,0:22:10.71,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa and Mama are getting along!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.39,0:22:21.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I told you that we were never \Nfighting to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We have cake, Miss Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:26.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want some cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:29.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, now. You're going to \Nbother the people downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(388,290)\fscx65}THE GREAT DODGEBALL PLAN
